Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:12:55 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Raw-stream mode: unfiltered tonehole readings and breath
 pressure as SysEx every main-loop pass

CC 106 = 79/80/81 on channel 7: enter / exit / resend calibration.
Data frame F0 7D 'W' 'R' 01 seq, 9 x 14-bit tonehole readings (baseline-corrected,
before the adaptive filter), 14-bit pressure, F7. Calibration frame 02 carries the
full-cover readings and ambient pressure. USB only; normal MIDI output unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BVn59Fo2GJfXh2PF5NPZ19
